  category       String                      @default("ENGAGEMENT") // ONBOARDING, ENGAGEMENT, RETENTION, REACTIVATION, MILESTONE, MEMBERSHIP, ATTENDANCE, TRAINING, COMMUNICATION, SYSTEM
  triggerType    String                      // e.g. MEMBER_INACTIVE, CLASS_NO_SHOW, etc.
